{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"幂等单子"},0],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"title":[{"Plain":"幂等单子"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>幂等单子是满足如下等价条件的"},{"Local":{"url":"单子","text":"单子"}},{"Plain":" $T\\colon \\mathcal C \\to \\mathcal C$:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>乘法映射 $T^2 \\to T$ 为同构;</li>\n<li>$T$-"},{"Local":{"url":"单子上的代数","text":"代数"}},{"Plain":"范畴的"},{"Local":{"url":"自由-遗忘伴随","text":"遗忘"}},{"Plain":"函子 $\\mathcal C^T \\to \\mathcal C$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"全忠实函子","text":"全忠实函子"}},{"Plain":";</li>\n<li>对任意 $T$-代数 $A$, 其结构映射 $TA\\to A$ 为同构 (换言之, $T$-代数等同于 $T$-"},{"Local":{"url":"不动点","text":"不动点"}},{"Plain":");</li>\n<li>$T$ 是由一个"},{"Local":{"url":"自反子范畴","text":"自反子范畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal D\\hookrightarrow\\mathcal C$ 所"},{"Local":{"url":"伴随给出单子","text":"给出的单子"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n"}]}}